      "title": "BOOTSTRAP INSTRUCTIONS",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "BOOTSTRAP LoRA Dataset Generator\n\n1. FLUX UNET: flux1-dev.safetensors (fp8)\n2. LoRA Character (verde): sua LoRA \u2014 strength 1.0-1.2\n3. LoRA Skin Realism (azul): mode=4 (bypass) ou ative 0.4-0.7\n4. Positive Prompt: cole prompts do bootstrap_prompts.txt\n5. Image Size: batch=4, resolucao por tipo:\n   Rosto: 832x1216 | Meio corpo: 832x1216 | Corpo: 768x1344\n6. KSampler: CFG 1.0, euler, simple, 28 steps, RANDOMIZE\n7. Queue cada prompt. Curadoria automatica abaixo.\n\nSCORING:\n- Aesthetic Score > 7.0 (bom), > 8.0 (excelente)\n- Face Similarity cosine > 0.65 (similar), > 0.75 (muito similar)\n- Imagens aprovadas em bootstrap/approved/"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
